WEBVTT

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:14.670
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.910
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.240
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.350
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.290
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:36.070
l'm glad you accepted the offer.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.640
We don't want anybody's help.
So as things stand...

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.340
Two against two.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.610
You guys are respected.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.180
lf you take advantage of that to set a trap,

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.220
you can make victims out of dozens of people.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.990
Now that l know you're enemies,
I'll promptly take care of you.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.670
lt's the way it has to be.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:04.200
Oh, my. But please wait thirty minutes until security's final patrol.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.140
After that, if we tinker with the security system a bit,

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.940
we won't have to worry about people who might be watching

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:13.980
and we'll be able to fight uninterrupted.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.420
You don't look so good, Muto.
Can you fight like that?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.920
What you said about wanting to become as strong as you possibly could...

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:26.550
those are words of a warrior who battles enemies that do harm to people, right?

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.390
Are those words insincere?

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.230
They're not insincere or anything. l'm serious.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:38.000
But... l thought you were a dependable senior...

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:40.370
l thought you were people l had to protect,

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:42.780
not opponents to fight...

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.270
That's right. lndeed, you did protect me before.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:50.590
Thanks. But, l'm sorry.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.050
We don't need the likes of you to protect us.

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:58.920
What we need is the power to make our wish come true...

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:04.090
<i>lt Seems We're Well Matched</i>

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:12.640
The second gymnasium is all clear.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.170
All clear.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.480
Okay, our patrol's finished.
Let's get on home.

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:18.410
Right.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.080
Okay, now.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.320
Please sleep for a little while,
Mr. security system.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:32.460
Now even if windows break, a fire breaks out or people die,

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:36.800
this school will be all clear for the next four hours...until midnight.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.360
Are they gone?

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.230
Yeah.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:44.000
That was sure a slipshod patrol.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.670
That's how it goes with the work of lackadaisical people.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.250
The same goes for you, too.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:50.840
What?

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:54.410
Not much can be expected from the power of a lackadaisical warrior.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.620
lf you don't want to fight those siblings, then go home.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.190
I'll fight.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:04.150
l decided to become a warrior in order to protect people from homunculi.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.350
l'd appreciate it if you would do so.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.230
Missing this opportunity to defeat two at one time

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.570
would be bad for us in the future.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.030
This number of people as is...
Two against two.

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.640
lt's time...

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.100
Let's us duel to the death.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.610
But Ouka Senpai still isn't...

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.410
lt's not necessary for you to concern yourself with my older sister.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:33.250
l don't care who goes first.
Simultaneously would be fine.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:36.580
I'll let you guys have the first move for the surprise attack from before.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:40.890
Pretending to uphold the spirit of <i>Bushido</i> despite being the Homunculus you are?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.160
Tokiko, leave this to me...
Shusui Senpai!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.340
One on one, like during the training.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.640
Only until Ouka Hayasaka shows up.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:55.740
Thanks.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.500
Here l go!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:58.910
Buso Renkin!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.730
He guarded with the kakugane!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.160
As promised, l handed you the first move.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:18.330
Now! Buso Renkin!

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:23.030
<i>lts speed, its sharpness, it's abnormal!</i>

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.940
<i>As l thought, Shusui Hayasaka's...</i>
<i>Buso Renkin is...</i>

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:32.410
<i>A Japanese katana!</i>

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:33.910
Here l go, Muto!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.660
<i>Unlike a shinai, it'll be touch-and-go</i> <i>if l get hit even just a little bit!</i>

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:52.220
<i>Focus just on the sword point...!</i>

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.400
Ohhh.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.270
Kazuki!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.080
l'm okay! l can still manage!

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:14.620
That's right. l don't think you'd fall so easily just from this either.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.080
lt's as calculated.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.640
We can fight without worrying about walls and the floor!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:43.520
Really?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:49.660
lndeed... Also, it'll be easy to clean up the blood you spill.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.080
Here l go!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.970
That's one...for a start.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.040
Does your older sister prefer sneak attack tactics?

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:13.300
But that's fine.
<i>That's</i> what homunculi are about.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:15.970
The roof, huh?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.210
Kazuki, I'll leave this to you for a while.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.450
I'll deal with the older sister.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.420
Your Death Scythes are more efficient than l thought.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.890
But they won't reach her...

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:29.190
Now, Muto.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.220
Let's continue our duel of death.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.600
<i>Thanks to you, it made for</i> <i>some good training. Thanks.</i>

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.610
<i>You're definitely getting stronger, Muto.</i>
<i>And of course, so am l.</i>

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.770
<i>lt seems we're well matched.</i>

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.220
Kazuki.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:51.980
lt's okay. l know.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:57.280
lf l think of someone like them suffering or feeling sadness as well...

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.890
lt's okay. l can fight!

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.760
Energy full blast!

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.740
Sunlight Crasher!

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:19.070
l see. The special feature of that lance is

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.520
how the cloth portion materializes biological energy

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.850
and can convert that to an attack.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:30.690
However!

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.290
What? The energy vanished?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.600
Any amount of energy is absorbed by the blade

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.470
and emitted from the sageo.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.310
This is the special property of my Buso Renkin.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:57.980
Sword Samurai X. Energy-type attacks won't work on me at all.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.620
Sunlight Crasher!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.430
Again...

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:12.630
lt's futile. lf the blade directly touches or touches even a portion of a weapon,

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:15.170
not only will the energy be absorbed,

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:19.040
but the impact generated by that energy is absorbed as well.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:31.150
All attacks linked to energy become powerless before this Sword Samurai X.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:36.150
lt seems you and l really are a good match.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:41.090
ln other words, a head-on battle just with only our raw strength and skills.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.960
Exactly. A pure battle between a sword and a spear.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:46.860
Let's go!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:03.050
Get down. That's my VIP seat.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:11.490
Oh my, is that so? But tonight, it's my firing platform for picking you off.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:15.800
What?

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.600
Kazuki and Tokiko haven't returned yet?

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.700
Yes. We were with them until school let out.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.870
Speaking of which, it's rare for you to be here so late.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.670
lt's okay, Bravo.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.180
This happens all the time, so.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.210
Oh...

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.980
An earthquake! lt's an earthquake.
We're shaking now!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.590
Really? l don't feel it at all.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.650
l mean, why do you look so excited?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.420
Earthquake bulletin.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.730
Oh! l'm fighting the last boss right now...

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.530
What? There's nothing on the TV.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.000
Turn it back.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:06.850
Think a little more before you attack.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.510
Under these circumstances, traces will just keep increasing.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:14.090
Oh well, generally it's okay if no evidence itself remains.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.890
And it's not something for you to worry about,

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.020
since you are going to die now.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.300
<i>Archery Buso Renkin...</i>

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.500
<i>The special property is</i> <i>precise high-speed shooting</i>

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.130
<i>with that screwy automaton.</i>

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:34.800
<i>However... just that doesn't explain</i> <i>those parts on her right arm.</i>

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.600
<i>l should conclude that she has</i> <i>some other kind of hidden means...</i>

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.150
Death Scythe Buso Renkin.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:45.120
The special property is precise high-speed operation with a manipulator.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.010
lt somewhat resembles my Buso Renkin, huh?

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.090
However...

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:59.930
This Angel Gozen of mine is a little superior.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.570
Heh...

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:09.310
l've stopped thinking about taking you alive or picking up the pieces.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:11.870
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.280
Master Gozen, fire!

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:30.300
<i>She forsakes the arms and legs</i> <i>and only guards the vital points?!</i>

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.170
<i>lt's impossible to shoot her down!</i>

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.600
Master Gozen, go!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:35.140
What?!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:47.140
<i>l missed...</i>
<i>No...l was made to miss...</i>

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:52.520
Jeez, what a truly screwy doll!
You're a hindrance! Beat it!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.190
The Buso's been deactivated.
She's switched to retreat, huh?

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:05.590
<i>A sneak attack and escape.</i>
<i>And the end result is me looking like this?</i>

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.000
<i>How pathetic...</i>

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:12.970
<i>But!</i>

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:21.070
<i>lf l'm to make our wish come true...</i> <i>l don't care how tough it is.</i>

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:25.950
<i>For the time being, that person's not</i> <i>an opponent l can handle.</i>

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:30.490
<i>l must meet up with Shusui</i> <i>and regroup.</i>

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.230
<i>l wonder what's happening</i> <i>on Shusui's end.</i>

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:42.500
Fourteen cuts.
You've withstood quite a bit.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:47.370
Muto... l'm grateful to you.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.980
Thanks to this one week of training with you,

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.980
l've been able to get as strong as l possibly could.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.520
And thanks to your death,

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:03.650
l've arrived within one step of having my wish come true.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.790
lt must be lonely to die alone.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:10.030
Rest a bit at the entrance to the road leading to the other world.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:14.160
I'll send along one more person,
Tokiko Tsumura, right away.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:29.610
l'm not dead yet...

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:31.880
And l won't let Tokiko die either!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:36.650
How are you alive?
You've got fatal wounds in fourteen spots...

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.460
lt's not just you, Shusui Senpai.

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:43.090
l've also gotten as strong as l possibly could

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.030
thanks to this one week of training with you!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:49.600
<i>So he dodged</i> <i>by the skin of his teeth, huh...?</i>

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:54.580
<i>But even so, my physical ability</i> <i>is one level, two levels better...</i>

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:58.100
<i>Oh... Come to think of it, as l recall...</i>

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.940
Could it be that you've had some other...

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.880
Basic training as an alchemist warrior every night is ongoing!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.280
So you'd built up double the training as me, huh?

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:11.290
No wonder you'd improve by double.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:15.030
Among my comrades, l'm the most inexperienced.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.420
So l have to work the hardest...

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.060
Shusui Senpai...

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.340
What's the wish you talked about earlier?

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:25.570
Your wanting to get as strong as you possibly could

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.970
is for the sake of making that wish come true, right?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.510
What the heck is this wish you want to have come true so badly

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.240
that you'd give up being human?!

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:38.780
lt's not just my wish... lt's mine and my big sister's wish.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.790
I'll tell you if you want to know.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:43.750
However!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:48.690
<i>This fighting spirit... What is this?</i>

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:54.160
That is lF you can best my sword with that spear!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.700
<i>Reverse-dou!</i>

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.640
<i>lt's beyond my power to dodge</i> <i>before that speed!</i>

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:05.840
<i>And it's beyond my power</i> <i>to defend before that weight!</i>

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:10.780
<i>Shusui Senpai's knockout technique!</i>
<i>Once he unleashes it...</i>

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.750
You're going to die.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.750
l will kill you.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.790
The cut is an instant...

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.830
Close your eyes and relax your arms and legs.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.400
lf you do that, you won't have to feel any pain or fear.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:37.810
Somewhere, you're attempting to act according to your principles,

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.850
like when you gave me the first move before...

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:44.410
l want to know the wish you're attempting to make come true,

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.650
going so far as to quit being human!

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:50.050
You should be aware that you can't dodge or defend...

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.860
The only other conceivable means is to hit each other at the same time...

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.560
do-or-die, cutting flesh and bone...

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:02.000
This Sword Samurai X can slice through both flesh and bone at once.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:07.480
First I'll take that life!
Then I'll take the kakugane at my leisure!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:11.610
Unfortunately, my life and kakugane are the same.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.620
There's no way you can slice through them!

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.820
Muto... What?!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.620
l've cut through the flesh and bone!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.420
But, what's this?!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.000
Buso deactivated.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:37.460
My first move was stopped by kakugane, so now it's my turn vice-versa...

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:42.700
This kakugane l received from Tokiko is a new life...

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.680
A set of two. l won't give it up just like that!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.340
Once more.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:48.970
Buso!

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.990
Noooo...

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.560
Ouka...Senpai...

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:06.330
Shusui!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.160
Oh!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:20.110
<i>The wound is shifting to Ouka Senpai...</i>

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.880
Stop... Big Sister...

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.960
A Buso Renkin that takes over the damage...

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.000
Big Sister...

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.300
Shusui...

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:53.950
<i>But a wound like that just now</i> <i>should automatically heal in a homunculus...</i>

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.390
<i>Wounds in areas other than</i> <i>an emblem mark should not be fatal...</i>

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.750
<i>And yet... Why...?</i>

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.150
<i>Could it be that these two are...</i> <i>flesh-and-blood humans?</i>

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:06.690
Familiars, huh...?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:07.350
Oh...

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.430
Tokiko.

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.030
How're your wounds?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.460
They hurt, but I'll deal with it.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.670
More importantly, what do you mean by "Familiars"?

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:19.040
l didn't tell you, did l?

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:24.340
Familiars...are humans who pledge loyalty to homunculi.

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:29.780
No matter how superior to humans a homunculus may be as a single body,

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:34.080
it's quite difficult for them to survive alone hidden in human society.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.920
Each time they eat a human,

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.360
it becomes easier to be spotted by an alchemist warrior

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:41.690
and they're almost always terminated if discovered.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:47.530
Consequently, communities like the LXE are usually formed.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:51.070
And at that time, people like them are incorporated at the very bottom.

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:56.210
Those with authority and financial status supply that power

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.300
and those with nothing... become manpower and serve.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.580
An emblem mark?

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:08.310
Look closely. lt's fluorescent paint.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.420
Oh...

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.750
Familiars have this paint on

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.320
when they meet homunculi or when working under them.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:19.630
The story goes it's an arrangement so as not to get eaten by mistake...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.830
This verifies everything now.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:25.100
Shusui Senpai... Ouka Senpai...

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:26.940
Why...?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:32.410
As l recall, l promised to tell you if you bested the reverse-dou.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.410
What?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:39.790
Our wish is to become homunculi and live forever, just the two of us!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:45.890
ln sickness and in health.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.860
ln joy and in sorrow.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.630
For richer...

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.260
...or for poorer.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.600
To love and respect.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:20:00.140
To comfort and to protect.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:08.410
—Till death do us part.
—Till death do us part.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:16.930
Your softness will eventually cost you your life.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:18.100
Before that happens,

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.400
l will take away the means for you to fight!

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.930
l will end your life as a warrior!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.170
Next time, "Till Death Do Us Part."

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.270
I'll splatter your guts out!
